{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19860","headline":"君子勿郁郁士有谤毁者作诗以赠之 一 · 孟郊","name":"君子勿郁郁士有谤毁者作诗以赠之 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君子勿郁郁，听我青蝇歌。\n人间少平地，森耸山岳多。\n折輈不在道，覆舟不在河。\n须知一尺水，日夜增高波。\n叔孙毁仲尼，臧仓掩孟轲。\n兰艾不同香，自然难爲和。\n良玉烧不热，直竹文不颇。\n自古皆如此，其如道在何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}